  "body": "There is something deeply satisfying about a home that overdelivers the moment you step through the front door. From the street, this sweet Torbay property has all the charm of a classic Kiwi home, but step inside and it reveals something rather unexpected: a spacious, sun filled retreat with room for the whole family and all the practicalities of everyday life.\r\n\r\nInside, the space is generous where it matters most. Parents can retreat to the generous master bedroom, complete with a beautifully updated, stylish ensuite for effortless morning routines. The remaining two bedrooms are genuine doubles, giving growing kids, guests, flatmates or work from home setups plenty of room to spread out. Excellent built in storage, a separate laundry and internal access single garage make everyday living wonderfully easy, while the additional carport out front takes care of the extra wheels.\r\n\r\nThen there’s the backyard. This is a proper classic Kiwi lawn — fully fenced, private and ready for kids to run wild, pets to roam and friends to gather for long weekend BBQs and lazy summer afternoons. There’s also a surprising sense of privacy here, creating a peaceful little haven that feels wonderfully removed from the outside world.\r\n\r\nAnd this is where Torbay really comes into its own. You’re surrounded by the laid back coastal lifestyle that makes this part of the North Shore so easy to love. Beaches, coastal walks, local cafes and the village are all close by, with Waiake and Long Bay just down the road when you’re ready for a swim, a walk or a dose of that quintessential Auckland summer feeling. Families will also appreciate having two primary schools within walking distance, adding another layer of everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re stepping onto the property ladder, upsizing for the family or simply looking for a spacious home in a brilliant neighbourhood, this hidden Torbay sweetheart delivers.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
